     other proprietary notice contained in the Work.

For the avoidance of doubt: the Authorised Recipients are the team listed in
the PRD and the two sponsor organisations. Family members, friends,
employer-allocated contractors, students, interns, future hires, and any
"guest" or "invited" contributor whose email is not on the list in
